 with other remix features, every Short created with Add object and Reimagine will link back to the creator’s original video from the Shorts player. Creators who don’t want their videos included can always opt out \\u003ca href\x3d\\\x22https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/10623810?hl\x3den\\u0026amp;ref_topic\x3d10343432\\u0026amp;sjid\x3d9341624557803068713-NC#zippy\x3d%2Chow-do-i-restrict-the-use-of-my-content-in-others-shorts\\\x22 target\x3d\\\x22_blank\\\x22 rel\x3d\\\x22noopener\\\x22\\u003efollowing these instructions\\u003c/a\\u003e. To learn more, visit our \\u003ca href\x3d\\\x22https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/10623810?hl\x3den\\u0026amp;ref_topic\x3d10343432\\u0026amp;sjid\x3d790851280079430340-NA\\\x22 target\x3d\\\x22_blank\\\x22 rel\x3d\\\x22noopener\\\x22\\u003eHelp Center\\u003c/a\\u003e. We’ll keep you posted on our expansion plans!\\u003c/div\\u003e\x22,[],[1,null,null,1771961841041490,180375362],null,null,null,null,null,1772732682429517,100,null,null,180375362,1771961841041490,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[null,0.87796062231063843,0,\x22CiQzMjhhNzM3ZS1hYzU2LThmMjItY2Q5NS1mMjE3MGNjNmM0MTAQBBgF\x22,\x221:f0455a1e-3972-9540-6957-255ee6ba3a85\x22],null,null,null,null,\x22en\x22],null,[[\x22JJ (TeamYouTube)\x22,\x22https://storage.googleapis.com/support-forums-api/avatar/profile-180375362-9984728596689843029.png\x22,1663796326785247,\x22\x22,\x22\x22,\x22\x22,\x22\x22],[null,1663796326785247,100,null,[7]],180375362,1],[null,null,0,0],0,null,[],[],null,[[\x22JJ (TeamYouTube)\x22,\x22https://storage.googleapis.com/support-forums-api/avatar/profile-180375362-9984728596689843029.png\x22,1663796326785247,\x22\x22,\x22\x22,\x22\x22,\x22\x22],[null,1663796326785247,100,null,[7]],180375362,1]]],[[[[418393148,\x221773952827804535\x22,18138167,1775758010334335],null,402019709,\x22\\u003cb\\u003e[Mar 19, 2026] Testing “Discover videos with Previews”:\\u003c/b\\u003e We’re experimenting with a